# Shared append-heavy backlog: keep both sides on merge instead of conflicting.
# Path is case-sensitive to git — it must match the tracked spelling.
# Tradeoff: union keeps lines, not content — two sessions/machines recording
# the same entry (or a merge landing both a mid-write and a completed copy)
# survives as a literal duplicate. This hook's dedupeEntries() runs every
# SessionStart specifically to clean this back up automatically.
docs/TODO.md merge=union
